# ZACA: build-context ignore for Dockerfile.zaca. BuildKit prefers a
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the default .dockerignore. This mirrors the
# upstream .dockerignore but KEEPS **/.gitignore in the context: the frontend
# `prebuild` step runs `eslint --ignore-path .gitignore src`, which fails with
# ENOENT if frontend/.gitignore is stripped. See ZACA-CHANGES.md.
**/.classpath
**/.dockerignore
**/.env
**/.git
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/azds.yaml
**/bin
**/charts
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*
**/node_modules
**/npm-debug.log
**/obj
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
LICENSE
README.md
